  "description": "Retells the opening of the K’iche’ Maya Popol Wuj: the creators’ council, failed peoples of mud and wood, Seven Macaw’s false claim to cosmic authority, his sons and the origins of the Hero Twins. Explores reciprocal obligations, K’iche’ paired language and nested stories, and the preservation of Indigenous knowledge in the surviving colonial-era manuscript.",
